  "Storgatan":"Storgatan",
  "Rättviks affärsgata sedan sekelskiftet 1900, med bevarade skyltfönster; genomfartstrafiken flyttades härifrån på 1980-talet.":"Rättvik's shopping street since around 1900, with its old shop windows; through traffic was moved off it in the 1980s.",
